 rep(d,'Upon the termination or expiration of this Agreement for any reason','Upon termination or expiration: (a) Platform access terminates, except the perpetual Section 5.2 license; (b) Customer ceases Platform use other than under that license; (c) Vendor returns/deletes Customer Data under Section 6.7; (d) accrued Fees become due; (e) Confidential Information is returned/destroyed subject to law; (f) Vendor provides up to ninety (90) days’ transition assistance at no charge for chronic-SLA termination; and (g) Vendor exports Customer-Trained Adaptations by API in an industry-standard format within thirty (30) days. The Section 5.2 non-assertion covenant survives.')
 rep(d,'Vendor shall fine-tune the Base Model using Customer Data','Vendor shall fine-tune the Base Model using Customer Data to achieve F1 ≥ 0.92 during Stabilization and F1 ≥ 0.94 beginning January 1, 2026 against the mutually agreed validation dataset.')
 for t in d.tables:
