 rep(d,'If p95 latency exceeds 400 ms','If p95 latency exceeds 450 ms for any month, an additional 5% Service Credit ($10,000) applies, subject to the overall monthly cap in Section 5(c).')
 rep(d,'If the F1 score falls below 0.94','If F1 falls below 0.92 during Stabilization or below 0.94 beginning January 1, 2026, an additional 10% Service Credit ($20,000) applies, subject to the overall monthly cap in Section 5(c).')
 rep(d,'(c) Maximum Credits.','(c) Maximum Credits. Aggregate Service Credits in any month shall not exceed twenty percent (20%) of the monthly Annual Platform Fee ($40,000). Credits are cumulative across SLA categories but shall not exceed the 20% aggregate cap.')
